# CrowdStrike Falcon Digest
#
# All configuration is now managed through the dashboard Settings page.
# On first launch, create an admin account and enter your credentials in Settings.
#
# If you have an existing .env file, credentials will be automatically
# migrated to encrypted storage on first startup.
#
# Cloud regions:
#   US-1:   https://api.crowdstrike.com
#   US-2:   https://api.us-2.crowdstrike.com
#   US-3:   https://api.us-3.crowdstrike.com
#   EU-1:   https://api.eu-1.crowdstrike.com
#   GOV-1:  https://api.laggar.gcw.crowdstrike.com
#   GOV-2:  https://api.us-gov-2.crowdstrike.mil
